# openOODA Organization

A systems language for AI-assisted work. Effects take capability tokens.
The product path is: typecheck, emit C / direct machine code, execute.

Public portal: https://openOODA.github.io
Governance and roadmap: `openOODA/SHIPPED.oot` and `openOODA/ROADMAP.oot`.

## Product Scope

- Compiler and CLI live in `ooda`. Commands: `check`, `build`, `run`, `test`, `fix`, `patch`, `lsp`.
- Native backends: C99 + runtime/chs_rt.c, direct x86-64 ELF64, direct AArch64 ELF64, standalone WASM.
- Product standard library in `ooda/std/` (pure `.oo` capability-gated modules).
- Editor support in `vscode/` and `tree-sitter/`.

