## Build from Checkout

From an `ooda` tree:

```bash
cd ooda
bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build oodac/main.oo oodac/oodac
./oodac/oodac check oodac/main.oo
./bin/ooda run fixtures/hello.oo
```

